{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/246760-submissions","id":246760,"title":"Submissions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-02T05:33:58-07:00","id":246760,"title":"Submissions","content":"Ok So i submitted something to the Onyx Path and I don't know how long to wait to get a response. Also i don't know if i will even get a response at all? I just want to make sure it got in and all the paper work was done right. I worried if i message someone it might hurt my chances. Does anyone have any advice?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-04T16:02:03-07:00","id":249262,"title":"","content":"I'd say if you sent them sometime and haven't heard anything, can't hurt to contact someone about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T14:25:26-07:00","id":253588,"title":"","content":"The standard time for short story publications to get back to an author is 6-8 weeks; that seems like a reasonable expectation to me in this case as well.<br /> <br /> It's kind of funny that I should see this topic today, because I'm preparing my own submission. Instead of spending the last several hours in a job search, I finally threw up my hands and wrote down that idea I've had for the last several months. I probably should have sent in during the all-call but didn't think of it at the time--back then it was just a few paragraphs without any real context. I really hope that 1,000 words of fiction is okay in lieu of (or even better, qualifies as) <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">1,000 words of setting text</a> because I think that fiction turned out pretty well. Tomorrow I'll start looking the document over and keep tweaking it until I run out of ways to second-guess myself, at which point I'll finally hand it in. I hope they include advice in their rejection letters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/233-daydreamer","name":"Daydreamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar233_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"193"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-09T16:16:25-07:00","id":253656,"title":"","content":"Give it three months from time of submission, seems like a good guideline.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}